Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Hermes, how fast is\Nthis thing going right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,170? 200?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting off of this thing! Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But when those rods came into my life\Nand I saw them for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally realized its importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't about the dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The moon landing was an\Nachievement for all humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.94,0:00:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That day, we humans conquered\Nthe moon and our spirits evolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's truly significant is the\Nevolution of the human race!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't gotta worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I honestly don't even feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.98,0:00:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to all the shit I've\Ngone through to get to the priest,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.78,0:00:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,this pain is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You crazy bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.24,0:01:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to test my spirit,\Nit's way stronger than yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.10,0:01:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna finish you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.56,0:01:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.36,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene! Aw, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be special since the priest\Ntook away the disc with his memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And he decided to keep him\Nalive in that prison...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he happens to be the\Npriest's biological brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! To Orlando!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.32,0:01:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where we'll find him hiding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.36,0:01:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Destiny is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.06,0:02:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:02:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,for joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a thing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,no, no, no, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,no, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,no,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Get surgery room 3 prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got an eight-year-old\Nboy in critical condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You said this is where the priest was\Nhiding, but this is a fucking hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:03:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's definitely waiting for us inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.46,0:04:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to put an end to this here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.74,0:04:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to take my father's\Ndisc and deliver it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.56,0:04:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you call this number, the\NSpeedwagon Foundation will come get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.14,0:04:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go in with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but before that, I need you\Nto make sure the disc gets delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.18,0:04:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,By now, the priest should sense\Nthat I'm getting closer to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be separated\Nfrom you right now either,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep in touch with this\Ncell phone I took off Rikyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.40,0:05:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'd like to hear your opinion\Non something I'm unsure of,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.44,0:05:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,particularly this dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.36,0:05:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a bite if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to taste test it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Versus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One bite is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,After you eat it, tell me\Nwhat ingredients are inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's shellfish, I can't eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm allergic, so I would get quite sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is whitefish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely, flounder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:05:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been paired with this flan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:06:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A delectable pudding mixed with\Nasparagus and mashed up crab meat inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.60,0:06:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I detect no shellfish
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But hold on a second May\NI have another small bite
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time with a little\Ndab of sauce on the side
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a faint scent from the sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by the fishy aroma I suspect\Nit's scallop paste mixed with cream
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate! Just as I thought,\Nthere are scallops inside the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,sauce is your shoe size 27\Ncentimeters pardon me but could you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,stand for a moment be careful\Nnot to open up the bullet wound
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,on your leg slowly now you're
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,about 181 centimeters tall yes and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you weigh precisely 72 kilograms\Nare your clothes size 52 and do
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:07:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,you tighten your watch belt on the\Nsecond hole yes how interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,though I'm unable to enjoy this\Nfine meal I'm quite impressed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,by your ability to pick out\Nthe scallop from And the sauce,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it would appear we have\Na similar sense of taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.64,0:07:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.18,0:07:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Father Pucci,\Nwhat are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're aware I haven't\Nseen my own ability yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and plus I can sense someone\Nquickly approaching our location.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help in any way I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, their arrival might\Nactually prove useful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.94,0:07:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's really close now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.88,0:08:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're still unable\Nto see your ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,then there's nothing\Nelse that can be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't struggle against things\Nbeyond your understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the power take its own course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.86,0:08:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If we are going to make it to heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.44,0:08:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you must ally yourself with the\Npower that lies dormant within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, there's a chance Jolene\Nmight overlook this room entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided to order this dish because they\Ntold me there'd be no shellfish inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.26,0:08:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd like, you may eat it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Father Pooji
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a lot of fun going\Nfor a ride in the ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was ruined because\Nmy daddy doesn't like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My daddy's the one who shot me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey! Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.02,0:09:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, what happened? Someone was shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to take him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.92,0:09:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This hospital room is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That priest must have been in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, where the fuck is he hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.96,0:09:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's safe to assume\Nthat the new enemy that's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.34,0:09:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,been hanging around the priest\Nis the cause of all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, that gunshot didn't\Nexactly feel like a stand attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more like somebody\Nfired a real bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.16,0:09:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And the poor bastard that got shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who even is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:10:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he be the one to get hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, looking at him, he seems\Nto be just a random, ordinary dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to hurry and evacuate everyone\Non this floor now. Yes, sir! Hey, that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,goes for you two as well hurry up and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,evacuate I'm gonna go\Ncall the police that's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,right I remember that man now he's the\Nparent of that kid who was brought in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,By the ambulance when we first got to\Nthis place. Maybe it was a test shot. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what kind\Nof ability it could be,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but if it's someone who just\Nhad their powers awakened,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,they would need to give it a test drive
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and try it out on somebody first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The priest is moving right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard's inside the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:10:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense him getting\Nfurther away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.10,0:11:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just throw yourself\Ninto the hole like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.90,0:11:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm against you on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody could see it's an obvious trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even go near the thing until we can\Nfind a clear connection between this deep,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.34,0:11:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,dark abyss and the man who\Ngot shot up in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever dug this hole started tunneling\Nto the side when they got deep enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.98,0:11:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.42,0:11:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The person that's accompanying Father\NPoochie right now goes by the name Versus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,25, male.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.80,0:11:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it before and I'll say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't going down in this damn hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just wait for him to climb out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,or we gotta find a way to\Ndrag them out like rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:12:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already well aware that\Nthis hole is an obvious trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.46,0:12:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happens if the priest is\Nplanning to hole himself up down
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,there for three more days while\Nhe waits for the new moon to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,given how capable he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Poochie and his accomplice plan to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.74,0:12:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,escape all the way to\NCape Canaveral like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.44,0:12:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In three days,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.58,0:12:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,that man's going to develop\Nsome new ability that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,will help him attain his\Nabsurd idea of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.54,0:12:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But for now, all he has is Pale Snake,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,which merely allows him to\Ncontrol the memories of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If we strike him now, we can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.82,0:12:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't avoid it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.54,0:12:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to end this for good,\Nwe might have to kill the priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let go, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.98,0:12:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.83,0:12:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.75,0:12:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If we both go, who's going to\Nstay here to help pull me back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.92,0:12:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my rope and wrap it around your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.74,0:12:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If I need help, I'll signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.87,0:13:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull me out of here, whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.34,0:13:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But still though, Jolene,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.42,0:13:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,if you keep pulling this\Nthread out of your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,just how far can you go\Nbefore you run out of slack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene! Jolene! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.82,0:13:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you answering me? Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.76,0:14:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I? 2005? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She came all this way\Ndragging her rope behind her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.48,0:14:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, hey! Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Start pulling me up! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna cut the rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.22,0:14:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.14,0:14:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.05,0:14:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull me out of the fucking hole! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:14:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it, what the ever living\Nfuck is going on down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:15:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't have really\Ngone that far into the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Hermes! Keep pulling!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to pull me up even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you've come uninvited\Nand haven't greeted me, you may stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.10,0:15:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You chose to come into my hall\Nwith your own volition. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I must insist the entirety of this tightly\Npulled rope comes in with you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.94,0:15:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.80,0:15:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Versus, will you be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to you who has recently\Ndeveloped a new stand ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.86,0:16:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Cujo has undergone intense training\Nthrough her experiences in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She is much more accustomed\Nto all-out battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not surprising that she would steal a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,pen from one of the\Npassengers on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.54,0:16:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not pursue Jolene any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You have done enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Versus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If Jolene wants to escape\Nfrom this hole, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't attempt to\Ncome back inside again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.10,0:16:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,At least not for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, all we can do is wait patiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need to stay here\Nfor three more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me up there, Hermes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see a light now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be getting close to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull me up even harder,\Nokay? Yeah! Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.30,0:16:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm starting to be able to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.72,0:16:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is down in this deep hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.58,0:16:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is staring\Nright at me as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I could see the priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to come up with another\Nway for us to get down here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It would have been over\Nif they'd cut this rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.52,0:17:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me something I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, come on now, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.30,0:17:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a little curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I really want to know,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.00,0:17:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,how did it feel to get revenge on the\Nson of a bitch who murdered your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get some sort of sick\Nsatisfaction out of burring
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.40,0:17:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,me alive in that sewer pipe\Nyou called an improv coffin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sports Maximum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.58,0:17:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on, Hermes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.94,0:17:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The ground has a long memory of\Neverything that happens upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sort of like a tape recorder, or\Neven much like a digital camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For example,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it remembers that boy who was shot dead by
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,his own father when he\Nfell onto the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:17:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It even remembers the\Ngangster who was buried
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.80,0:18:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,alive in a sewer pipe\Nand drowned to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.12,0:18:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Earth's memory is so powerful that it\Ncan even recall every single one of the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.18,0:18:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,passengers who met their demise on a plane\Nthat fell to the ground in July of 2005,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hermes! Stop! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.58,0:18:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here thanks to Versus Standability.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.82,0:18:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,See,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.73,0:18:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Netherworld uncovers all\Nthe folks who met the ground
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.40,0:18:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,when they perished and\Nexcavates their memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.57,0:18:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,this plane is expected\Nto lose control and crash
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,into the ground at approximately\N21.33 on July 21st, 2005.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We ask that you please turn off\Nall electronic devices and make
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.18,0:18:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,sure that your seatbelt is securely\Nfastened around your lower waist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest you heed that warning,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.02,0:19:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,or you'll end up like the man who\Nwas sitting in the seat behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.02,0:19:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,His head was lodged straight\Ninto my stomach on impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Ain't no way. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.46,0:19:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Start looking, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what even is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.88,0:19:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a hallucination, Jolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be on the ceiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look for the place we came in from!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything in this fucking\Nplane feels so real, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.24,0:19:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find the way out of here, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you fell down, was there anyone\Ncoming to check the room above the hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.38,0:19:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a panic in the halls\Nafter that boy's dad was shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The police had to have shown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have no clue. Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,even if the cops came, they\Nwouldn't be able to hear us calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.54,0:19:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,just like I couldn't hear\Nyou up there earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.98,0:19:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this plane down here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anything like this when I\Nwas waiting for you to come out the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.08,0:19:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please refrain from punching the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:19:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you would, kindly take\Nyour seat and wait quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.62,0:20:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This plane will be crashing\Nin less than three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then let us see the pilot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.36,0:20:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta make him land\Nthis plane immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up, lady, and\Ntake us to the cockpit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.82,0:20:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.82,0:20:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't able to land the plane safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.90,0:20:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the reason why we crashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.44,0:20:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for us,\Nwe all burned to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,When the plane crash landed, it exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.06,0:20:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And that was when my body...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.62,0:20:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you not hear me\Nwhen I told everyone to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,turn off all of their\Nelectronic devices earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It was flight number 2882 to Dallas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.68,0:20:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Around six or seven years ago, it\Ncrashed somewhere near Orlando.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dealing with ghosts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're memories. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:21:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Remnants of memories that\Nwere recorded by the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell me we're\Nactually gonna crash in this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.82,0:21:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you not make this plane\Ncrash happen any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been sensing weather forecasts\Ngetting closer to our position.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that he is drawing\Never closer toward this hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.38,0:21:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear to God, if you don't shut the fuck\Nup already and stop confusing me. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you speaking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Netherworld's ability is to\Nexcavate memories from the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And this plane is set to crash\Nspecifically at 2133 on the dot. Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.34,0:21:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,try not to forget that\NI've capitalized on this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,opportunity and managed to pull\NUrmas into my hole as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.20,0:22:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have done this all for you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.24,0:22:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.32,0:22:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.82,0:22:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.82,0:22:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.82,0:22:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:23:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.98,0:23:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.88,0:23:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All the things
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.78,0:23:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.96,0:23:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.36,0:23:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,a distant dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.48,0:23:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,dreaming far
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.26,0:23:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,away from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.72,0:23:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.98,0:24:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
